I go to the large counter.
The counter is completely made of glass.
There are many cakes and sweet pastries there.
Everything looks very delicious.
A waiter stands behind the counter.
He looks very friendly.
He is still speaking with another customer.
I wait for a moment.
I look at the selection.
There is apple cake and cheesecake.
I like apple cake, but today I do not want fruit.
I need something sweet.
Then I see the chocolate cake.
It looks fantastic.
The cake is very dark.
I love chocolate very much.
My decision is easy.
I want a piece of chocolate cake.
The other customer goes to her table.
The waiter looks at me and smiles.
